  that no one else can do luckily there's  an x-force film currently in development  and the end of the film certainly seems  to set up a team spin-off so one way or  another there looks to be more Deadpool  in our future and hopefully more Peter -  that guy is the best as it turns out we  are looking for someone with diabetes  Peters your man thanks for watching  click the looper icon to subscribe to  our YouTube channel plus check out all  this cool stuff we know you'll love -  you  [Music]
 

